error[M0014]: cannot use Square{…} (value of struct type
              Square) as Shape value in argument to
              describe: Square does not implement Shape
              (method Area has pointer receiver)
  --> ./main.go:26:11
   |
 5 | type Shape interface {
   |      ----- `Shape` is declared here
 ...
13 | func (s *Square) Area() float64 { return s.side * s.side }
   |         ------- `Area` has a pointer receiver
 ...
15 | func (s Square) Perimter() float64 { return 4 * s.side }
   |                 -------- `Perimter` is declared here;
   |                          `Shape` needs `Perimeter`
 ...
26 |     describe(Square{side: 2})
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `Square` does not
   |                              implement `Shape`
   |
   = note: `Square` lacks 3 methods of `Shape`:
             `Area` has a pointer receiver, so only
               `*Square` has it
             `Perimeter() float64` is missing; `Square` has
               `Perimter`
             `Name() string` is missing
